      "content": "The quiet... it sounds so much better than the noise. A part of me feels like if I stayed, I'd just be a burden, a walking ghost of a mistake. But I keep thinking... wouldn't it be more of a disgrace to just hide in the dark? Wouldn't a real leader find a way to make things right, even if it's the last thing they ever do?",
